0.01: New App!
0.02: Redesign: ribbed dial, recessed fan aperture, plate-clipped needle, circular jump-hour window
0.03: Widgets hidden by default, swipe down to reveal; face now uses the full screen
0.04: Instrument cluster: FUEL(battery) and BPM(heart) pods, STEPS odometer; removed MIN label
0.05: Cluster raised clear of the main gauge; odometer crowns the arc; pod layout now pivot-relative
0.06: Settings page with 5 selectable themes
0.07: Touch controls: date peek, live HR, trip odometer, theme swipe, flyback demo; settings for all persisted options
0.08: Fix widget bar reappearing on lock and stuck overlay on swipe: replaced overlay swipeOn with deterministic hide/show reveal
0.09: Pressure-trend chevrons flanking the hour disc (barometer sampled every 15 min); animation only runs while unlocked. New "Pressure trend" setting.
0.10: Unlit trend chevrons now visible as dim lenses (were panel-coloured, i.e. invisible)
0.11: Chevrons actually visible: unlit is thin white engraving, lit is thick yellow (blue-on-black failed on-device twice)
